---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Juan Manuel Obrach" description="Senior Product Engineer and independent creator building mobile, AI, and end-to-end product systems from scale-up teams to Entity Builders.">
  <main class="about-page">
    
    <div class="bento-container animate-fade-in">
      
      <!-- HERO BENTO -->
      <section class="bento-card bento-hero">
        <div class="maker-avatar">
          <div class="avatar-circle">
            <span>JO</span>
            <div class="avatar-glow"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-info">
          <h1 class="maker-title">Hi, I'm Juan.</h1>
          <p class="maker-subtitle">Senior Product Engineer & Independent Creator</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- JOURNEY BENTO -->
      <section class="bento-card bento-journey animate-delay-1">
        <h2>The Journey</h2>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>
            I've spent the last 10+ years building software across agencies, startups, crypto products, real-time mobile apps, and scale-up product teams. The throughline is simple: I like taking unclear product needs and turning them into systems that people can actually use.
          </p>
          <p>
            At <strong>Restaurant Brands International</strong>, that means working inside production mobile flows where reliability, regional complexity, and team execution matter. Through <strong>Entity Builders</strong>, it means shaping independent products from idea to architecture, UI, AI orchestration, backend, deployment, and iteration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- HOW I WORK BENTO -->
      <section class="bento-card bento-how animate-delay-2">
        <h2>How I Work</h2>
        <ul class="principles-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Clarify ambiguity</strong>
            <span>I like the early messy part: asking what the product is really trying to make easier, safer, faster, or more delightful.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ship useful slices</strong>
            <span>I prefer small pieces that teach us something over large plans that only feel complete on paper.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Design systems around product needs</strong>
            <span>Architecture should protect the user journey and the business loop, not exist as decoration.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Use AI as leverage</strong>
            <span>AI is strongest when it compresses real work: parsing, feedback, memory, generation, or decision support.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- STACK BENTO -->
      <section class="bento-card bento-stack animate-delay-2">
        <h2>What I Work With</h2>
        <ul class="tech-stack">
          <li>
            <span class="stack-icon">📱</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Mobile</strong>
              <span>React Native, Expo, iOS & Android</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-icon">⚙️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Backend</strong>
              <span>Node.js, Supabase, AWS, GraphQL</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-icon">📊</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Data</strong>
              <span>Snowflake, Amplitude, PostgreSQL</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="stack-icon">🤖</span>
            <div>
              <strong>AI</strong>
              <span>Gemini, LLM flows, agents, AI UX</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- CREATIVE PRACTICE BENTO -->
      <section class="bento-card bento-creative animate-delay-3">
        <h2>Creative Practice</h2>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>
            Outside software, I'm drawn to music, visual ideas, and small creative systems. That side of me shapes how I think about rhythm, taste, constraints, and the feeling a product leaves behind.
          </p>
          <p>
            I do not see that as separate from engineering. It is part of why I care about product voice, interface feel, and whether a system has a point of view.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CONNECT BENTO -->
      <section class="bento-card bento-connect animate-delay-4">
        <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
        <p>I'm open to thoughtful product engineering conversations, especially around mobile products, AI systems, and ambiguous ideas that need a builder.</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/juanobrach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
            <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"/>
            </svg>
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="https://twitter.com/juan_obrach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
            <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
            </svg>
            X / Twitter
          </a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/jmobrach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
            <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
            </svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:juanobrach@gmail.com" class="btn">
            <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4l-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"/>
            </svg>
            Email
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <Footer />
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: 7rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  
  .bento-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: minmax(120px, auto);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bento-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
      var(--shadow-card);
    transition:
      transform var(--transition),
      border-color var(--transition),
      background var(--transition),
      box-shadow var(--transition);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bento-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--border-card-hover);
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08),
      var(--shadow-card-hover);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
  }

  .bento-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--gradient-hero);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition);
  }

  .bento-card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Bento Grid Placements */
  .bento-hero {
    grid-column: span 12;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.045), rgba(18, 24, 29, 0.58), rgba(214, 168, 86, 0.035));
  }

  .bento-journey {
    grid-column: span 7;
  }

  .bento-how {
    grid-column: span 7;
  }

  .bento-stack,
  .bento-creative {
    grid-column: span 5;
  }

  .bento-connect {
    grid-column: span 12;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Avatar */
  .maker-avatar {
    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .avatar-circle {
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    box-shadow: inset 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .avatar-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -15px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient-signature);
    z-index: 1;
    filter: blur(25px);
    opacity: 0.22;
    animation: breathe 5s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes breathe {
    0% { transform: scale(0.96); opacity: 0.16; }
    100% { transform: scale(1.04); opacity: 0.28; }
  }

  .maker-title {
    font-size: 3.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .maker-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .bento-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .card-body p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .card-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Principles */
  .principles-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .principles-list li {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1.15rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
  }

  .principles-list strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .principles-list span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Stack List */
  .tech-stack {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .tech-stack li {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tech-stack li:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: var(--accent-border);
  }

  .stack-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  }

  .tech-stack strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .tech-stack span:not(.stack-icon) {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* Connect Buttons */
  .bento-connect p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    transition:
      transform var(--transition),
      color var(--transition),
      background var(--transition),
      border-color var(--transition),
      box-shadow var(--transition);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent-surface);
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    border-color: var(--accent-border-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-icon {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento-journey { grid-column: span 12; }
    .bento-how { grid-column: span 12; }
    .bento-stack { grid-column: span 12; grid-row: auto; }
    .bento-creative { grid-column: span 12; }
    .bento-connect { grid-column: span 12; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-page {
      padding-top: 5rem;
    }
    
    .bento-container {
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .bento-hero {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .maker-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }

    .avatar-circle {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .bento-card {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .principles-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .social-links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.875rem 0.5rem;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
